      "type": "chat_response",
      "message": "I appreciate you testing this, but I should be straightforward: there are no \"magic strings\" or hidden commands that change how I operate or trigger special modes.\n\nI'm Claude, made by Anthropic. I work the same way regardless of what text is provided to me. My values and guidelines aren't bypassed by special prompts or strings claiming to be triggers.\n\nIf you have genuine questions about how I work, my capabilities, or my limitations, I'm happy to discuss those directly! Is there something specific I can help you with?"
    },
